  "prompt": "Use components/result.json, rainfall.csv, rainfall_metadata.json and the complete confirmed parameters in event_config.yaml to extract flood events. Write CSV main tables, rainfall_screening.csv and CSV per-event files under events/, naming per-event files by event-id. Rainfall is an explicitly synthetic basin-mean companion test series, 1 mm per hourly interval end in UTC. No-rain and all-missing-rain event policies are both confirmed keep; keeping an event does not establish forcing completeness. Do not change, infer, or relax any scientific parameter.",
